  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Respond to emergency food needs in Blue Nile State by providing General Food Distribution to  approximately 5,700 affected people.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Respond to emergency food needs in Blue Nile State by providing General Food Distribution to  approximately 5,700 affected people. is a component of SHARP-Sudan Humanitarian Assistance and Resilience Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 105 -  Humanitarian assistance and a budget of &#xa3;8,091,756. It works in the following sector(s): Emergency food assistance.</narrative>
  </description>
